ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/202608250308302812_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/202608250308302812_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【战报新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-25/match2067655date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">三叉戟爆发！切尔西3-2富勒姆 帕尔默佩德罗互送助攻罗杰斯建功</a>·</p><p>帕尔默、佩德罗互相传射，贡萨洛·加西亚破门，切尔西以3-2客场击败富勒姆，取得新赛季开门红。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-25/6a8cafabc482dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英超首轮积分榜：布莱顿因净胜球领跑，枪手第2，维拉垫底热刺倒2</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-25/match2057384date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">大胜！罗马主场4-0佛罗伦萨领跑意甲 马伦帽子戏法迪巴拉三助攻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.64" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260825/zhanbao_image_2057384_1787603772_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.64" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.64" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260825/zhanbao_image_2057384_1787603772_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260825/zhanbao_image_2057384_1787603772_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>马伦戴帽，迪巴拉三次助攻，罗马4-0击败佛罗伦萨，首轮结束后排名积分榜榜首。</p><p><strong>【转会新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-24/6a8c69d9e5fc1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：纽卡总价5000万镑签曼城中场尼科·冈萨雷斯达协议</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/202608242357227074_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/202608242357227074_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/202608242357227074_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺以标志性的“Here we go”确认，纽卡将从曼城签下尼科·冈萨雷斯，总价5000万英镑。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-25/6a8c84fd07c7cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：曼城4000万欧+浮动签帕尔梅拉斯22岁边锋阿兰达协议</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/202608250203376054_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/202608250203376054_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/202608250203376054_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺以标志性的“HWG”确认，曼城以4000万欧+浮动价格从帕尔梅拉斯签巴西边锋阿兰达协议。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-25/6a8c6c3b3249bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">大换血！曼城今夏一线队离队球员上双 敲定布阿迪＆1.3亿签安德森</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-24/6a8c4ea5c4fc7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：利雅得新月接近签下马丁内利！转会费5000万-5500万镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.24" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/202608242202046053.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.24" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.24" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/202608242202046053.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/202608242202046053.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺报道，利雅得新月接近完成阿森纳前锋马丁内利的转会。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-25/6a8c76317d493native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">与热刺竞争！罗马诺：曼城与加克波团队取得联系，相关谈判已开始</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.24" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250522/682f2d5b3ab70.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.24" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.24" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250522/682f2d5b3ab70.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250522/682f2d5b3ab70.jpg"> </div><p>据罗马诺报道，曼城已经与利物浦左边锋加克波的团队取得联系，尝试签下他。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-25/6a8c79cfe4740native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：利物浦未来8天内签2名边锋才会卖加克波，曼城正积极谈判</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-24/6a8c55a3c8b7dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">法鹰血亏数百万！德媒：曼城巧妙规避二转，两笔交易打包一高一低</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/202608242240187852_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/202608242240187852_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/202608242240187852_1280.jpg"> </div><p>德国媒体ran指出，曼城与热刺的这一转会操作，可能使马尔穆什的前东家法兰克福蒙受数百万欧元的损失。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-25/6a8c730cb6ad4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">镜报：塔帅愿花1.3亿镑签下小蜘蛛，但需要确保球员真想加盟枪手</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/6a8c157cae3b8_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color